#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An introduction to quantum machine learning (QML), data encoding, kernel "
"methods and variational quantum circuits."
msgstr "양자 머신 러닝(QML), 데이터 인코딩, 커널 방법, 변분 양자 회로에 대한 소개입니다."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "개요 {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
